    <string name="settings_draw_icons_note">When the icon library has nothing that fits, the app draws one. Drawing a new icon takes about 10 s and costs about 1.5¢ (US).</string>
    <string name="settings_help_title">About your key</string>
    <string name="settings_help_budget">Make the key in its own OpenAI project with a monthly budget and \"Enforce a hard limit\" turned on, so a lost phone or a leaked key can\'t run up a big bill.</string>
    <string name="settings_help_restricted">A restricted key is enough: List models (Read), Model capabilities (Request) and Responses API (Write). One key per person.</string>
    <string name="settings_help_guide">If someone else made your key, they have a step-by-step guide for these settings.</string>
    <string name="settings_help_privacy">Text, photos and recordings go to OpenAI when you ask the app to sort or read them. Item names also go there in the background, to sort them into aisles and to pick or draw their icons (you can turn drawing off above).</string>
